# EXPLORATORY AUDIT (not a release demo): Group-B same-skeleton walk -> jog graph.
# This is the FEASIBLE half of the requested stand->walk->jog graph: the strict
# joint-offset gate splits the Center corpus so that NO single skeleton holds
# stand + walk + jog. Full-offset skeleton groups:
#   Group A (hash 06ea4620): standStill, standReallyStill, walkCurvedLong
#   Group B (hash 6953dd4e): walkCurve, jogCurve, walkToJog, walkStraightTwiceAsFast,
#                            walkTightCurve, walkMoreCurve, walkSpiral, walkFastSpiral
# Stand lives only in Group A; jog only in Group B. So stand->walk is possible in
# Group A (stand + walkCurvedLong) and walk->jog is possible in Group B, but the two
# cannot be merged without retargeting (forbidden by the audit constraints).
#
# Group B is the strong case: it contains walkToJog.bvh, a RECORDED walk->jog
# transition on this exact rig, so walk and jog poses are genuinely close.
# Measured raw min Kovar D (--dump-distance-grid): walk->jog 275, jog->walk 237 --
# far below the CMU subj16 cross-gait wall (D~2709, no transition clip existed).
#
# Cyclic windows (cycle_joint LeftAnkle):
#   walk: walkCurve 127-160  loop-seam score 0.012 (clean)
#   jog : jogCurve   1-24     loop-seam score 0.447 (marginal; short curvy clip)
# Two same-clip windows per node satisfy the >=2-example simplex rule; this audit
# tests EDGE feasibility, not within-node parametric span (spanned_axes 0).

node walk 1
registration walk LeftAnkle - 3 0
parameter_metrics walk travel_speed
parameter_calibration walk 9
parameter_support walk simplex
example walk 9.9 ../BVH/walkCurve.bvh start_frame 127 end_frame 160
example walk 10.0 ../BVH/walkCurve.bvh start_frame 125 end_frame 158

node jog 1
registration jog LeftAnkle - 3 0
parameter_metrics jog travel_speed
parameter_calibration jog 9
parameter_support jog simplex
example jog 21.9 ../BVH/jogCurve.bvh start_frame 1 end_frame 24
example jog 21.5 ../BVH/jogCurve.bvh start_frame 3 end_frame 26

edge walk walk
edge_phase_range walk walk 0.70 0.95 0.05 0.30
edge_config walk walk 120 234 3 6 41

edge jog jog
edge_phase_range jog jog 0.70 0.95 0.05 0.30
edge_config jog jog 300 600 3 6 41

edge walk jog
edge_phase_range walk jog 0.60 0.95 0.05 0.40
edge_config walk jog 300 520 4 6 41

edge jog walk
edge_phase_range jog walk 0.60 0.95 0.05 0.40
edge_config jog walk 260 480 4 6 41
